# Alo King Complete Conversational-Commerce Operating System

## Product goal

Alo King should feel like a smart Lebanese food concierge inside WhatsApp:

- the customer can speak naturally in Lebanese Arabic, Arabizi, English, or mixed language;
- the bot remembers useful preferences without feeling invasive;
- the menu is live, visual, searchable, and easy to tap;
- the cart is always accurate and reversible;
- ordering never happens without clear confirmation;
- restaurants receive reliable, actionable orders;
- customers get the right notification at the right moment;
- loyalty and referrals create repeat behavior without becoming spam;
- every cancellation, failure, refund, and exception has a defined path.

> **The AI writes the conversation. The backend owns the truth. The customer owns consent.**

---

# 1. Non-negotiable design principles

## 1.1 Server-owned facts

The database and backend must own:

- menu items;
- prices in USD and LBP;
- availability;
- restaurant hours;
- delivery villages and fees;
- preparation times;
- order totals;
- COD limits;
- payment state;
- driver status;
- campaign eligibility;
- loyalty balances;
- referral rewards;
- notification delivery state.

The AI can select a tool and phrase a response, but it must never invent any of these facts.

## 1.2 One clear step per turn

- One rich WhatsApp message wherever possible.
- At most three messages in a turn.
- Prefer buttons and lists over typing.
- Every card includes a way back to **Menu** or **Basket**.
- Ask one clarification question at a time.
- Never repeat a question already answered in the current state or verified memory.

## 1.3 No silent side effects

The customer must explicitly confirm before:

- creating an order;
- paying or applying credits;
- changing a confirmed order;
- accepting a substitution;
- cancelling after the restaurant accepts;
- subscribing to marketing;
- using a referral reward when it changes the total.

## 1.4 Fail soft

Every error ends with:

1. a short explanation;
2. a useful next action;
3. no stack trace or silent failure.

