# 11. Referral strategy

## 11.1 Referral mechanics

Each customer receives a short referral token:

```text
https://alo.king/r?c=HANI84
```

A referral becomes valid only when:

1. a new customer enters through the token;
2. the new customer is not an existing customer in disguise;
3. the new customer completes a qualifying order;
4. the order is delivered and not refunded or cancelled.

## 11.2 Recommended reward

Start with:

```text
Give $2, get $2
```

But control abuse through:

- one first-order reward per new customer;
- device/phone/payment/address risk checks where lawful and appropriate;
- no self-referrals;
- no reward for cancelled or refunded orders;
- monthly referral caps;
- delayed reward until delivery is complete.

## 11.3 Sharing experience

After a successful order:

> Want to give a friend **$2 off their first Alo King order**? Share your referral link.

Buttons:

```text
Share link
My referral rewards
Not now
```

Provide a prewritten WhatsApp message without exposing private order details.

## 11.4 Referral attribution

Store:

```text
referral_id
referrer_customer_id
new_customer_id
source
created_at
qualifying_order_id
reward_status
fraud_review_status
```

Do not pay commissions based solely on a typed QR code or self-reported source.

