# 14. Notification and event architecture

Every event should be processed through an outbox:

```text
business_event
→ notification_outbox
→ eligibility/window check
→ template or free-form selection
→ send attempt
→ provider status webhook
→ dedupe/update
→ customer timeline
```

Required idempotency keys:

```text
order_id + notification_type
campaign_id + recipient_id
loyalty_event_id
referral_reward_id
payment_event_id
```

Never allow webhook retries to create duplicate orders, duplicate rewards, or duplicate messages.

